        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"1d022c0e-cfd5-40f0-884a-b7ab593904e6\",\"review_text\":\"you get exactly what you want.\"},{\"review_id\":\"74454806-a479-446b-8e57-c0e85dfa2969\",\"review_text\":\"enjoy much sound trip\"},{\"review_id\":\"fd7e1ad9-bae3-4449-9ef2-68489ce2cf30\",\"review_text\":\"We love Spotify in my house, walking my dog, gaming, at work...there is a playlist for everything! 6 stars!\"},{\"review_id\":\"6e4a507c-2dbd-4d46-8d89-dc166e6fc8fd\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing experience\"},{\"review_id\":\"8126dc83-b053-40ef-9c1d-ac849ff35480\",\"review_text\":\"The variety is just amazing, everyone!!! Thank you 😊\"},{\"review_id\":\"6c60def7-f5d5-463f-983c-06246826da58\",\"review_text\":\"Editing my review ... the last upadate was really annoying ! Like bhik mangne ki ye konsa naya tareekaa hai!! Worst appp... always running behind money!! Report this app.. it should be removed from play store... worst !! Totally worstt and ridiculous🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮#hateyou\"},{\"review_id\":\"1e49fea3-cd54-4866-86e2-d7bc2115f10a\",\"review_text\":\"Resso is not good but Spotify music is best 🔥🔥🔥\"},{\"review_id\":\"81acba9e-344a-408e-a415-a6733ff3e93d\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing audio quality\"},{\"review_id\":\"cc19bab9-5021-4733-8426-0c28b5ea930d\",\"review_text\":\"easy to use and has alot of content. love the ff feature for advertisements.\"},{\"review_id\":\"05acf9b2-ec7a-4ac8-9811-3262afbe1f75\",\"review_text\":\"Good choice of music that's free to use you can go premium if you choose\"}]}"
